    "layer-norm-backward-markdown-code-1": "xhat=(x-mean)*rstd, g=dy*gamma\ndx=rstd*(g-mean(g)-xhat*mean(g*xhat))\ndgamma[j]=Σ dy[i,j]*xhat[i,j]\ndbeta[j]=Σ dy[i,j]",
